            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu wikaghenda na kughireda; wikakuaghia viwanda kula mundu aighu nyumbenyi kwake, na wazenyi, na waza ya hekalu, na waza ya wandu wose kaavui na andu kuwangwaghwa Mbenge ya Machi, na wazenyi kwa Mbenge ya Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose werewurieghe kufuma wubarishonyi wikaagha viwanda na kukaia andenyi; angu kufuma ngelo ra Jeshua mwana wa Nuni hata ituku ijo, wandu wa Israeli ndewerekoghe wabonya huwo. Kukakaia kuboilwa kubaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kufuma ituku ja imbiri ja ndima hata ituku ja kutua, Ezra orekoghe ukishoma chuo cha Sharia ya Mlungu ituku ituku. Werebonyreghe ndima kwa matuku fungade, na ituku ja wunyanya korekoghe na ikwanyiko ibaa jefunga kunughana na mafundisho gha Sharia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
